  'ohelp.pg.dashboard.s7h': 'Plan and payment banners',
  'ohelp.pg.dashboard.s7b': 'Coloured banners may appear at the top: a green trial banner (days remaining), a red payment-pending banner if a charge failed, or an upgrade prompt on the Core plan. Each links straight to Settings → Subscription to fix or upgrade.',
  'ohelp.action.goToAudience': 'Open Subscribers',
  'ohelp.pg.subscription.title': 'Subscription',
  'ohelp.pg.subscription.desc': 'Your plan, your Stripe payout account, and the fees, all in one place.',
  'ohelp.pg.subscription.s1h': 'What this page does',
  'ohelp.pg.subscription.s1b': 'Subscription (Settings → Subscription) is where you manage your Yuno plan, connect the Stripe account that pays you, and see exactly what each sale costs. No money moves until Stripe here is connected.',
  'ohelp.pg.subscription.s2h': 'Tour of the screen',
  'ohelp.pg.subscription.s2b': 'Current Plan shows your tier (e.g. Pro, €99/month) with an Active badge and a Manage payment button. Stripe Account shows whether your payout account is connected (Account connected, Active), with Stripe Dashboard and Refresh buttons and a "What is Stripe?" explainer. At the bottom, Yuno commissions lists the service fees per product.',
  'ohelp.pg.subscription.s3h': 'Plans and what they unlock',
  'ohelp.pg.subscription.s3b': 'Yuno Core is free — you only pay the per-sale fees — and it already covers the essentials: events, ticketing, guest list, bar orders, the drink menu, staff PINs (up to 5), invoices, refunds, basic analytics, basic VIP tables, scarcity tools, plus discovering and booking DJs and accepting collaborations. The paid plans build on top. Essential (€49/month) lifts the staff cap to unlimited, removes the "Powered by Yuno" branding, and adds promotional email campaigns, the customer CRM and full promoter management. Pro (€99/month, the popular one) adds advanced analytics, CSV export, full VIP tables and VIP service, DJ and organizer orchestration with automatic payouts, Live Night, upsells, loyalty / CRM and Hype Score. Elite (€199/month) is coming soon for multi-venue groups and API access — not purchasable yet. A "Compare plans" grid lists exactly what each includes; if a menu item is greyed out, your plan does not include it yet.',
  'ohelp.pg.subscription.s4h': 'Connect Stripe to get paid',
  'ohelp.pg.subscription.s4b': '1. In Stripe Account, start the connection.\n2. Complete Stripe\'s onboarding (your bank details, ID).\n3. Wait for the status to show Account connected, Active.\n4. You can now sell, payouts land in your bank automatically, no manual requests.',
  'ohelp.pg.subscription.s5h': 'Fees explained',
  'ohelp.pg.subscription.s5b': 'Two layers: Stripe takes a payment processing fee (about 1.5% + €0.25 per transaction) for handling cards securely. Yuno adds a service fee per product, Drinks 3%, Tickets 4% (min €0.99), VIP Tables 4% (min €0.99). Both are deducted automatically; the rest is paid out to you.',
  'ohelp.pg.subscription.s6h': 'Manage your plan and payment',
  'ohelp.pg.subscription.s6b': 'Manage payment opens your billing details to update the card you pay Yuno with, change tier, or download your subscription invoices. Stripe Dashboard jumps to Stripe for your payout history.',
  'ohelp.pg.subscription.s7h': 'Heads up',
  'ohelp.pg.subscription.s7b': 'Without an Active Stripe account you cannot collect a cent, ticketing, tables and bar orders all need it. Connect Stripe before you open sales, not the night of.',
  'ohelp.pg.subscription.s8h': 'Tip',
  'ohelp.pg.subscription.s8b': 'The fees are on the revenue, not your subscription. If you sell little, you pay little beyond the monthly plan; the service fee scales with what you actually take in.',
  'ohelp.action.goToOrders': 'Go to Orders →',
