  'ohelp.glossary.term.stripeConnect': 'Stripe Connect is the payment platform that allows your venue to receive payments directly from customers.',
  'ohelp.glossary.term.qrCode': 'A scannable code displayed on tickets or orders, used to verify entry or retrieve drinks at the bar.',
  'ohelp.glossary.term.guestList': 'A free entry list for an event. Guests register and get a QR code to scan at the door.',
  'ohelp.glossary.term.rls': 'Row Level Security — database rules that control who can see or edit which data.',
  'ohelp.glossary.term.mfa': 'Multi-Factor Authentication — an extra security step requiring a code from an authenticator app.',
  'ohelp.glossary.term.pin': 'A 6-digit code used by staff (barmen, bouncers) to log in quickly on shared devices.',
  'ohelp.glossary.term.clickCollect': 'A system where customers pre-order drinks online and collect them at the bar by scanning their QR code.',
  'ohelp.glossary.term.hypeScore': 'A score from 0 to 10 measuring the momentum and engagement of an upcoming event.',
  'ohelp.glossary.term.crm': 'Customer Relationship Management — tools to track, segment, and communicate with your venue\'s customers.',
  'ohelp.glossary.term.loyalty': 'A points-based reward system where customers earn points on every purchase and can redeem rewards.',
  'ohelp.glossary.term.presale': 'Drinks sold at a discounted price before the event starts, boosting early engagement.',
  'ohelp.glossary.term.applicationFee': 'The commission Yuno takes on each transaction, combining the Yuno service fee and estimated Stripe processing fee.',
  'ohelp.glossary.term.serviceFee': 'The fee added on top of the item price that is paid by the customer. 3% for drinks, max(0.99€, 4%) for tickets and tables.',
  'ohelp.glossary.term.planCore': 'The free base plan. You pay only the per-sale fees and get events, ticketing, guest list, bar orders, menu, staff PINs (up to 5), invoices, basic analytics, basic VIP tables, scarcity tools, DJ booking and accepting collaborations.',
  'ohelp.glossary.term.planEssential': 'The €49/month plan. Builds on Core with unlimited staff, removes the "Powered by Yuno" branding, and adds promotional email campaigns, the customer CRM and full promoter management.',
  'ohelp.glossary.term.planPro': 'The €99/month plan (the popular one) adding advanced analytics, CSV export, full VIP tables and service, DJ and organizer orchestration with automatic payouts, Live Night, upsells, loyalty/CRM and Hype Score.',
  'ohelp.glossary.term.planElite': 'The €199/month plan, coming soon. Aimed at multi-venue groups (group management, API access); not purchasable yet.',
  'ohelp.glossary.term.onboarding': 'The 9-step guided setup wizard that walks new owners through configuring their venue on Yuno.',
  'ohelp.glossary.term.guestCheckout': 'A checkout mode allowing customers to purchase without creating an account. Available only for public sales.',
  'ohelp.glossary.term.commissionTemplate': 'A reusable set of commission rules (percentages, fixed amounts, quotas) assigned to promoters.',
  'ohelp.glossary.term.upsell': 'Offers and bundles presented to customers during checkout to increase average order value.',
  'ohelp.glossary.term.waitlist': 'A signup list for sold-out events. Registered users get notified when tickets become available.',
